277 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 214 0 R
/T (BCIT built its reputation on being fast-paced and hands-on, the kind of school that prepares students for real work, not just theory. MyBCIT, the portal every student depends on daily, doesn't reflect that at all. It's outdated, confusing to navigate, and the gap between the school's actual identity and its digital front door is hard to miss once you notice it.)
/E (BCIT built its reputation on being fast-paced and hands-on, the kind of school that prepares students for real work, not just theory. MyBCIT, the portal every student depends on daily, doesn't reflect that at all. It's outdated, confusing to navigate, and the gap between the school's actual identity and its digital front door is hard to miss once you notice it.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
