/T (I wanted questions that would surface specific friction, not just general opinions, since "I don't like it" doesn't tell you what actually to fix. So alongside asking how people felt about MyBCIT, I asked about concrete tasks and behaviours: what they avoid, how long something takes, whether they'd even want a new feature like AI support. The specifics mattered more than the feelings. Are you familiar with MyBCIT, and how often do you use it?)
