385 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 225 0 R
/T (Jimmy Ho is a first-year Computer Science student at BCIT. He arrived with high expectations, and the people lived up to them; he quickly found a talented, supportive circle of friends. The platform did not. Despite asking family, friends, and even ChatGPT for help, Jimmy could never quite figure out how to navigate MyBCIT and resorted to clicking around and taking notes just to find what he needed. When BCIT announced a campus-wide competition to redesign the outdated platform, Jimmy saw an opportunity to fix the exact problem he had been living with for weeks. He partnered with a group of friends skilled in design and development, and their collaboration paid off: the redesign placed first in the competition and became the new face of MyBCIT.)
/E (Jimmy Ho is a first-year Computer Science student at BCIT. He arrived with high expectations, and the people lived up to them; he quickly found a talented, supportive circle of friends. The platform did not. Despite asking family, friends, and even ChatGPT for help, Jimmy could never quite figure out how to navigate MyBCIT and resorted to clicking around and taking notes just to find what he needed. When BCIT announced a campus-wide competition to redesign the outdated platform, Jimmy saw an opportunity to fix the exact problem he had been living with for weeks. He partnered with a group of friends skilled in design and development, and their collaboration paid off: the redesign placed first in the competition and became the new face of MyBCIT.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
