/P 227 0 R
/T (Every stage fed the next one directly. Brand research told me what I couldn't change: the colours, the sense of institutional trust BCIT already had. Sketching let me test navigation ideas quickly, before getting attached to anything. Low-fidelity wireframes were where the click-reduction goal actually got tested for the first time, and multiple rounds of high fidelity in Figma were less about polish and more about making sure the accessibility changes held up once real content and spacing were in play, not just in a rough sketch. Nothing here was decorative; every stage existed because the previous one revealed something that needed solving.)
/E (Every stage fed the next one directly. Brand research told me what I couldn't change: the colours, the sense of institutional trust BCIT already had. Sketching let me test navigation ideas quickly, before getting attached to anything. Low-fidelity wireframes were where the click-reduction goal actually got tested for the first time, and multiple rounds of high fidelity in Figma were less about polish and more about making sure the accessibility changes held up once real content and spacing were in play, not just in a rough sketch. Nothing here was decorative; every stage existed because the previous one revealed something that needed solving.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
