467 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 233 0 R
/T (None of the individual changes were dramatic. Fewer clicks to grades, larger text, consolidated navigation, on paper that's a modest list. But testing showed those small changes were the whole difference between a platform people tolerated and one they'd actually call approachable. That's probably the biggest thing this project taught me: the most important design decisions are often the least visible ones, the stuff nobody notices until it's finally fixed.)
/E (None of the individual changes were dramatic. Fewer clicks to grades, larger text, consolidated navigation, on paper that's a modest list. But testing showed those small changes were the whole difference between a platform people tolerated and one they'd actually call approachable. That's probably the biggest thing this project taught me: the most important design decisions are often the least visible ones, the stuff nobody notices until it's finally fixed.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [4]
>>
