/T (There's more I'd want to validate before calling this finished. A second, more structured round of usability testing would confirm whether the changes actually hold up under real use, not just first impressions. Tracking navigation patterns through heatmaps would show whether click depth genuinely dropped in practice, not just in theory. And the AI support idea participants brought up early on is worth exploring properly, though it raises real questions about handling sensitive student data responsibly, questions I'd want answered before building anything, not after.)
