1071 0 obj
<<
/Title (BCIT built its reputation on being fast-paced and hands-on, the kind of school that prepares students for real work, not just theory. MyBCIT, the portal every student depends on daily, doesn't reflect that at all. It's outdated, confusing to navigate, and the gap between the school's actual identity and its digital front door is hard to miss once you notice it.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 945 0 R
/Next 1072 0 R
>>
endobj
1072 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project set out to close that gap: over ten interviews, several rounds of prototyping, and usability testing shaped a redesign that cuts down navigation complexity and improves accessibility, while still looking unmistakably like BCIT, not a generic template that happens to use their colours.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 945 0 R
/Prev 1071 0 R
>>
endobj
