1189 0 obj
<<
/Title (I wanted questions that would surface specific friction, not just general opinions, since "I don't like it" doesn't tell you what actually to fix. So alongside asking how people felt about MyBCIT, I asked about concrete tasks and behaviours: what they avoid, how long something takes, whether they'd even want a new feature like AI support. The specifics mattered more than the feelings. Are you familiar with MyBCIT, and how often do you use it?)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1184 0 R
/First 1197 0 R
/Last 1198 0 R
/Count -5
>>
endobj
1190 0 obj
<<
/Title (By the fourth or fifth interview, I could predict what someone was about to say before they said it. The complaints weren't scattered; they converged on the same handful of problems:)
