<<
/Title (The redesigned user flow directly addresses the clicking overload participants identified during testing. Features such as grade checking, a daily memo overlay, an integrated chat function, and course information displayed directly on the home page were added to meet students' actual needs, while also modernizing MyBCIT's platform without compromising its existing brand identity.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1202 0 R
>>
endobj
